sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Sender as 发送者 Angular
    participant Port as CommandPort Tauri
    participant Helix as helix-im Send Application
    participant Pending as PendingSend Aggregate
    participant SQLite as Local SQLite message
    participant Projector as Timeline Projector
    participant Frame as InteractionFrame V2
    participant Runtime as Angular SurfaceRuntime
    participant GoAPI as Go posts/create
    participant PG as Remote PG Transaction
    participant Outbox as delivery_outbox
    participant WS as WebSocket post
    participant Observer as 观察者 Angular

    Sender->>Port: im_send_message(channel_id,type,text,props?,replied?,req_id?)
    Port->>Helix: Tick::Command with trusted actor and clock
    Port-->>Sender: AcceptedCommand(reqId,command,helixCommand,accepted=true)
    Note over Sender,Port: receipt only means queued and is not a delivery state

    Helix->>Helix: allocate temporaryId and build CreatePostBody
    Helix->>Pending: insert Local with timer and request correlation
    Helix->>SQLite: Persist optimistic message(send_status=sending)
    SQLite-->>Helix: PersistOk(P1 corr)
    Helix->>Projector: read attached timeline window
    Projector->>SQLite: Query message by channel and window
    SQLite-->>Projector: authoritative local rows
    Projector->>Frame: compose schemaVersion=2 timeline mutation
    Frame-->>Runtime: im:interaction:frame delivery=sending
    Runtime->>Runtime: decode all, validate epoch/revision, stage, atomic swap
    Runtime-->>Port: __helix_frame_applied(transactionId,appliedSlots,result)
    Runtime-->>Sender: render same row as sending

    Helix->>GoAPI: POST /api/cses/posts/create + Cses-Track-Id
    GoAPI->>PG: post + channel + channel_member + channel_event + outbox in one transaction
    PG-->>GoAPI: commit with postId and eventSeq
    GoAPI-->>Helix: CommonRes status=SUCCESS, optional serverId

    alt SUCCESS contains serverId
        Helix->>Pending: reconcile(serverId)
        Pending->>SQLite: Persist id=serverId, send_status=sent
        Pending->>Helix: CancelTimer and remove pending
    else SUCCESS without serverId
        Helix->>Pending: mark_sent_pending_server_id
        Pending->>SQLite: Persist send_status=sent, keep pending for identity
        Pending->>Helix: CancelTimer
    else HTTP PortError
        Helix->>Pending: mark_failed_immediately
        Pending->>SQLite: Persist send_status=unsend
        Pending->>Helix: CancelTimer
    else malformed or status not SUCCESS
        Helix->>Pending: keep pending
        Pending-->>SQLite: timer later persists send_status=unsend
    end

    SQLite-->>Helix: terminal PersistOk
    Helix->>Projector: read timeline again
    Projector->>Frame: compose terminal timeline mutation
    Frame-->>Runtime: delivery=sent or failed
    Runtime->>Runtime: atomic stage and swap
    Runtime-->>Port: FrameApplied content-free ack
    Runtime-->>Sender: render terminal delivery

    PG->>Outbox: committed pending delivery
    Outbox->>WS: publish event=post with post and eventSeq
    WS-->>Helix: sender echo or recovery fact
    Helix->>Pending: reconcile by temporaryId when still pending
    Pending->>SQLite: idempotent id=serverId and send_status=sent
    WS-->>Observer: post event
    Observer->>Observer: own Helix Persist then V2 projection

    Note over Frame,Runtime: CURRENT G01 mutations are message.timeline only
    Note over Frame,Observer: TARGET impact policy may compose channel-derived surfaces when facts and revisions change
